{
  "version": "0.5.3-beta.8",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.3-beta.7`\n\n### Features\n\n- let local bash, zsh and fish on macOS and Linux mark their commands through an opt-in shell integration ([95a0c1d9](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/95a0c1d98270faec811e6cd89d11364442d32da3))\n\n### Fixes\n\n- let the Enter or Escape that ends an IME composition on macOS stay with the input method instead of submitting, closing or navigating text fields ([b7e73ac9](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/b7e73ac987249269f5c073322be09c687eabaeeb))\n- keep IME text that WebKit delivers before its keydown whenever no keydown diff is pending, so punctuation typed while the previous key or Caps Lock is still down is no longer dropped either ([5382a481](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/5382a481e9cde87c1a6980bb5c68f45f88dd27c1))\n- stop dropping the first IME punctuation typed with Shift held on macOS, which WebKit delivers before its keydown while xterm still counts the held Shift as a key in flight ([66966b2e](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/66966b2ed9cd42d36c43a133af0286001a971aea))\n- keep tTerm Dev's credential store key apart from the installed app's and reuse a key already there, so neither locks the other's saved passwords, and report locked passwords instead of a missing one ([85ff1c30](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/85ff1c3054794644fcaf71fd828cbb48d795a80b))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.3-beta.7...v0.5.3-beta.8](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.3-beta.7...v0.5.3-beta.8)\n",
